  "question": {
    "text": "A uniform rod of mass m and length <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi></math> is hinged at one of its end with the ceiling and another end of the rod is attached with a thread which is attached with the horizontal ceiling at point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math>. If one end of the rod is slightly displaced horizontally and perpendicular to the rod and released. If the time period of small oscillation is <math><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math>. Find <math><mi>x</mi><mo>.</mo></math><br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0050_e356fc9b8014.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 104px;\" />"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Consider a small angular displacement <math><mi>β</mi></math><br /><br />Torque about the rotational axis<br /><br /><math><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>α</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>α</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>β</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math>"
